  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這幾年來，自己因爲不能應時豹變，順合潮流的結果，所以弄得失去了職業，失去了朋友親人，失去了一切的一切，只成了孤零丁的一個，落在時代的後面浮沉着。",
      "output_sha256": "670f0f128ff19571722d5223794882ac79cfab6f1ef8a1f95cdc501d7db956ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "670f0f128ff19571722d5223794882ac79cfab6f1ef8a1f95cdc501d7db956ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人家要我沒落，但肉體卻仍舊在維持着它的舊日的作用，不肯好好兒的消亡下去。",
      "output_sha256": "4ce61d939b9a26b9cce24b1b1c08b6dd656e6693a06f2161b77d12fad3e4efe2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ce61d939b9a26b9cce24b1b1c08b6dd656e6693a06f2161b77d12fad3e4efe2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人家勸我自殺，但窮得連買一點藥買一支手槍的餘裕都沒有，而墜落頹廢的我的意志也連豎直耳朵，聽一聽人家的勸告的毅力都決拿不起來。",
      "output_sha256": "d0489e33c2be51983cd3c6d21fc79cc376b5bb152f110077365eac9a6e083f97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0489e33c2be51983cd3c6d21fc79cc376b5bb152f110077365eac9a6e083f97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在這無可奈何的楚歌聲裏，自然而然，我便成了一個與豬狗一樣的一點兒自決心責任心也沒有的行屍走肉了，對這一個行屍，人家還在說是什麼“運命論者”。",
      "output_sha256": "16d94245376f8fe35c7f3003b3fc0b3562bb10689c7dcc584be01c270b521bd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "16d94245376f8fe35c7f3003b3fc0b3562bb10689c7dcc584be01c270b521bd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "無論被稱作宿命論者還是沉淪者，這樣的狀態無法改變。",
      "output_sha256": "b2a47134a2686bcca4ab9b66d72af37fe23958eef2d35df54633e4c96bd0b896",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.432857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5619ea722d1e9a89a3dfefbb46dce6f9cc0da029fe89ba8c88e0276cb0150bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b2a47134a2686bcca4ab9b66d72af37fe23958eef2d35df54633e4c96bd0b896",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，在這像豬一樣的行屍中，有時卻還不能完全抹去一些稍微高尚的感知和情感。",
      "output_sha256": "0abddd944b93cf179f632d0469368ea7df24634caf8d8184f32c8f00312316df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.432857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5619ea722d1e9a89a3dfefbb46dce6f9cc0da029fe89ba8c88e0276cb0150bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0abddd944b93cf179f632d0469368ea7df24634caf8d8184f32c8f00312316df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，偶爾會有一種深沉而悲痛的孤獨感如潮水般湧上心頭，宛如癲癇發作一般。",
      "output_sha256": "43ce359f0cf83cb35b1a5559f80da117c061bae32d0b63762c1ef7facf158c0e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.432857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5619ea722d1e9a89a3dfefbb46dce6f9cc0da029fe89ba8c88e0276cb0150bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "43ce359f0cf83cb35b1a5559f80da117c061bae32d0b63762c1ef7facf158c0e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一天，也是在這一種發作之後，我忽而想起了一位不相識的青年寫給我的幾封信。",
      "output_sha256": "927a008be0a51d65147b33fb712df35cf6bd8251007aead58d4db7b2160e57be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "927a008be0a51d65147b33fb712df35cf6bd8251007aead58d4db7b2160e57be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這一位好奇的青年，大約也同我一樣的在感到孤獨罷，他寫來的幾封滿貯着熱情的信上，說無論如何總想看一看我這一塊走肉。",
      "output_sha256": "e909863bcc67c6b1100db5afc5ec4b1048afe114a57e03bacd593034f169a6ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "e909863bcc67c6b1100db5afc5ec4b1048afe114a57e03bacd593034f169a6ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "想起了他，那一天早晨，我就借得了幾個零用錢，飄然坐上了車，走到了上海最熱鬧的一個地方去拜訪了一次。",
      "output_sha256": "a6467533c0d73b52fa3886217c63d33d3ad75276fa443fb3955d5a94c5341eb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6467533c0d73b52fa3886217c63d33d3ad75276fa443fb3955d5a94c5341eb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "兩人見面時，自然都感到了一種愉悅的情感。",
      "output_sha256": "a0ce1d2978816a3063670b840cc99e9e80c4e65b6d49def9ee56270edb46bfca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.462185,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7ea40fa9b2896883c0254bd73185f676cef9aa91005d9d961caec308f24ded35"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a0ce1d2978816a3063670b840cc99e9e80c4e65b6d49def9ee56270edb46bfca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也一時破了長久沉默的戒，滔滔談了許多前後不接的閒天，他也全身抖擻了起來，似乎是喜歡得不了的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "7cd18a3293a1cbca05df946e21e4d7db2614dfd66ff6f6df2f1b1ef3de4cd992",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cd18a3293a1cbca05df946e21e4d7db2614dfd66ff6f6df2f1b1ef3de4cd992",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "聊了一會兒，我感到肚子餓了，於是我們一起出去吃點心，吃飽後又繞著附近走了一圈，談了半天。",
      "output_sha256": "62a77fc9a2d29f52cafeccdc2622586ec5b3aac836c9d83b1b5e6b6ca97ec620",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.574337,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ec7a4946e74436ce595303d5fd96de82bee8cf984bacbdc6d1d6d8b3cd8629f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "62a77fc9a2d29f52cafeccdc2622586ec5b3aac836c9d83b1b5e6b6ca97ec620",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他怎麼也不肯和我別去，一定要邀我回到他的旅館去和他同吃午飯。",
      "output_sha256": "49442386399d568967bdbd85a6e99627acbaec5bfc7012a7b6da7e761f144da7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "49442386399d568967bdbd85a6e99627acbaec5bfc7012a7b6da7e761f144da7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但可憐的我那時候心裏頭又起了別的作用了，一時就想去看一回好久沒有見到而相約已經有好幾次的一位書店裏的熟人。",
      "output_sha256": "49049ead088bb259b7791a6d1cb8fa84fd0360abb2fbee273a0b8ce0c01a1b33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "49049ead088bb259b7791a6d1cb8fa84fd0360abb2fbee273a0b8ce0c01a1b33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就告訴他說，吃飯是不能同他在一道吃的。",
      "output_sha256": "3322aa1b631dd70a229f4ef4f695781e659fce615a1ee6c2218661e8e06761a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "3322aa1b631dd70a229f4ef4f695781e659fce615a1ee6c2218661e8e06761a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他問爲什麼？",
      "output_sha256": "000afe376ddacef83bcfcb482553973e21a31ffa22e4675497eb181c97d885e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "000afe376ddacef83bcfcb482553973e21a31ffa22e4675497eb181c97d885e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我說因爲今天是有人約我吃飯的。",
      "output_sha256": "4a0f752d998dea2d72358a82e72f134346c6f59dd39880b8fd21579f2adaf175",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a0f752d998dea2d72358a82e72f134346c6f59dd39880b8fd21579f2adaf175",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他問在什麼地方？",
      "output_sha256": "9db04bcfb816872490da3365bf3bf7159d5c14b38567c9be6c082223800c2547",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "9db04bcfb816872490da3365bf3bf7159d5c14b38567c9be6c082223800c2547",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我說在某處某地的書店樓上。",
      "output_sha256": "3f6dfb743a95854ab3d187d7ae566b9cadc88045f371f2ab8a37b93175f77eb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f6dfb743a95854ab3d187d7ae566b9cadc88045f371f2ab8a37b93175f77eb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他再問幾點，我說正午十二點。",
      "output_sha256": "12d47ffc2ee880916164bb815e567c29a7dccd222de89eafcf35bd707ded6e1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.808929,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3b5b306c16c6a7a00add179a60e8f02b9093497ff32b5646c3112128e631f5ff",
        "8ec9eda8d6b390849244f06f19d9841223453e98dd9747ad082e1a4af101b8af"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "12d47ffc2ee880916164bb815e567c29a7dccd222de89eafcf35bd707ded6e1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此他就很悲哀地和我在馬路上分開了手，我回頭來看了幾眼，看見他老遠的還立在那裏目送我的行。",
      "output_sha256": "321025acd49a4c403dc2e0a83b635bec79fc0ec955e714b6aea1e0bce62a845f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "321025acd49a4c403dc2e0a83b635bec79fc0ec955e714b6aea1e0bce62a845f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "與他分開後，我去見那位書店的熟人，但不幸的是，吃飯的地點臨時改了。",
      "output_sha256": "baf5b55423c1d299b4cfea50734bd29aef394dbbf92345d7d19d8c9b6c02ad17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.701897,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c1df39d4075440172870ee56d629319366e94fda4eb8ac9e6770f53230739886"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "baf5b55423c1d299b4cfea50734bd29aef394dbbf92345d7d19d8c9b6c02ad17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們吃完飯後，坐到了兩點多鐘才走下樓來。",
      "output_sha256": "cccd8c5016c0d8988e9cc29738976e008532d9f2a23eec9e78ad1f1732d8e480",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "cccd8c5016c0d8988e9cc29738976e008532d9f2a23eec9e78ad1f1732d8e480",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "正當我走到一條寬廣的野道上時，突然看到前方有一位神采奕奕的青年向我走來。",
      "output_sha256": "8c0cfe8469e02734ea370a191c3cf2c0bc1b967608a309b156f1363c12a2a726",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.4235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "46f60151aa4c19e0607a0a930c37304d0a95e3c42356791273fb6b47cfc60f02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c0cfe8469e02734ea370a191c3cf2c0bc1b967608a309b156f1363c12a2a726",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走近來一看卻正是午前我去訪他和他在馬路上別去的那位純直的少年朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "f37ae9e40ffa37500efbd191833acf4659fb0b934a187f92b05a6c5a167b5cc4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "f37ae9e40ffa37500efbd191833acf4659fb0b934a187f92b05a6c5a167b5cc4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他站在我面前，面色通紅，眉毛緊皺，眼中似乎燃燒著火焰，整個人微微顫抖，直盯著我的臉，半晌無法說話，雙手緊握成拳，垂在肩下。",
      "output_sha256": "bb88d2ac7f870169ff140bcaf2f3b725c71ac8958fa445f6e792a97d850af077",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.386348,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3e93e8cb778b87a823a5ab139240c3dc7afa8e2359a0d13bf23166d7b867c1e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb88d2ac7f870169ff140bcaf2f3b725c71ac8958fa445f6e792a97d850af077",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我也如同被抓住贓物的賊一樣，心急如焚，完全無法開口。",
      "output_sha256": "cf758b3a9e2e049556d888da41ce812bd7e146275543b6dd16dc23d0ca928c1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.349914,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "380d66347496b2ff7bf7674b3f77134612682d7d0c99daa6769b1d585e5b697b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cf758b3a9e2e049556d888da41ce812bd7e146275543b6dd16dc23d0ca928c1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "兩人對頭呆立了一陣，終究還是我先破口說，“你上什麼地方去？”",
      "output_sha256": "fa58a04fef18d0719af47c588706ea6be64d024ccd34c645ef7df52b7432e2d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa58a04fef18d0719af47c588706ea6be64d024ccd34c645ef7df52b7432e2d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他默默地瞪了我一陣子，才高聲怒喝：“你為什麼要騙我？",
      "output_sha256": "1cf7e8a365ca14215abcfd70766358c77ad05171dc29ab1c37e6c77ee6652b31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.601532,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bc9bbb2fc7b124f40c9f8ba1c1e56cd84e8b581716434dc4db5d7a37ab358556"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1cf7e8a365ca14215abcfd70766358c77ad05171dc29ab1c37e6c77ee6652b31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你爲什麼要撒謊？”",
      "output_sha256": "7fa6e0376e1caddf3ff52b34d9ff58d988482f58a41f0703412fb93a515d0fb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "7fa6e0376e1caddf3ff52b34d9ff58d988482f58a41f0703412fb93a515d0fb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我看了他那雙冒火的眼光，覺得知覺也沒有了，神致也昏亂了，不曉回答了他幾句什麼樣的支吾言語，就匆匆逃開了他的面前。",
      "output_sha256": "33e18c662893877faab6dd0a7aba2a5d21c7389fbfcdbc875005ef4eb6693128",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "33e18c662893877faab6dd0a7aba2a5d21c7389fbfcdbc875005ef4eb6693128",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "同時，我的腦海中隱隱作痛，彷彿被一隻馬蜂刺了一下。",
      "output_sha256": "73bd80a4c08696d25be3a171816c2ea069fbf675fc24023e7afc02b194eaa175",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.416572,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1045538446ae9a51e93c9b61938159ddddd4266d5d2c532f130a70b02a6b7aaf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "73bd80a4c08696d25be3a171816c2ea069fbf675fc24023e7afc02b194eaa175",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我覺得這正是一隻馬蜂的毒刺，因爲我在這一次偶然的失言之中，所感到的苦痛不過是暫時的罷了，而在他的潔白的靈魂之上，怕不得不印上一個極深刻的永也消不去的毒印。",
      "output_sha256": "31b34f5bf0ee6c858a516f0f8aedd9e6acb713995fe1669ee0b85ca94bdba3e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "31b34f5bf0ee6c858a516f0f8aedd9e6acb713995fe1669ee0b85ca94bdba3e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "聽說馬蜂尾上的毒刺是隻有一次好用的，這是它最後的一件自衛武器，這一次的他豈不也同馬蜂一樣，受了我的永久的害毒了麼？",
      "output_sha256": "1cc4dcc5eb477b58aa4d6bb5e24300cb7cb09570a5413dca169f120c360454ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "1cc4dcc5eb477b58aa4d6bb5e24300cb7cb09570a5413dca169f120c360454ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今每當我感到孤獨時，總會想起這件事，因此最近我甚至不敢讀任何人的信件，也不敢隨意走動。",
      "output_sha256": "9fcff32eb8bcb48209e044fff58d8801caff896ec8ab7d0bb8e6807dfe38c8ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.371295,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cc04de5169066b73d23119894344c91b7139ebb065ee1104c936dd641b51b26a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9fcff32eb8bcb48209e044fff58d8801caff896ec8ab7d0bb8e6807dfe38c8ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這一針小小的毒刺，大約是可以把我的孤獨釘住，使它隨伴我到我的墳墓裏去的，細細玩味起來，倒也能夠感到一點痛定之後的寬懷情緒，可是那隻馬蜂，那隻已經被我解除了武裝的馬蜂，卻太可憐了，我在此地還只想誠懇地乞求它的饒恕。",
      "output_sha256": "691d17dd559363cd824d6d3adb194c74ca8b8f04d9d24d918dabad37eff181c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "691d17dd559363cd824d6d3adb194c74ca8b8f04d9d24d918dabad37eff181c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一九二九年四月作",
      "output_sha256": "07d7c7ded142fcca17f19216b67362103b698c35da75f8abb4f0838c6c187f49",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "07d7c7ded142fcca17f19216b67362103b698c35da75f8abb4f0838c6c187f49",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "原載一九二九年一月二十日《大衆文藝》第五期，該期衍期出版",
      "output_sha256": "daac1a0048d43be33f1381a66a56b03f7ed6cd8f47b9b72542e7d91f017da1d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
